    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Settle in at the Maison symphonique and step into the magic of winter with the orchestra, as Roch Carrier’s The Hockey Sweater comes to life in a symphonic adaptation by Canadian composer Abigail Richardson-Schulte, full of humour and surprises. This concert is presented in French only. FAMILY MUSICAL TAG: ​ Concert for ages 6 and up that will delight the entire family."
      }
