    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>Following the huge success of their last visit and in celebration of their 25th anniversary, Le Vent du Nord returns to the Maison symphonique to bring cheer to winter with their spirited tunes, reels, jigs, and the vibrant rhythms of traditional Quebec music, all in a symphonic concert dedicated entirely to them. The theme of the evening? Joy, festivity, and warmth! Join this iconic group for a musical journey through their greatest albums—plus a few exclusive surprises—inside a hall transformed for one night into a true Symphonic Chalet.</p>\n<p>Late-Night concert! The Maison symphonique will be decorated at its finest to celebrate the holiday season. Stick around after the concert to hit the dance floor and enjoy live music!</p>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f8f4ff; border: 2px solid #7d50b3; padding: 25px; margin: 20px 0; border-radius: 0px; color: #2c2c2c; line-height: 1.6; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); width: 100%;\"><strong><em>IMMERSIVE</em> MUSICAL TAG: </strong>​<br />\nConcert offering a fascinating world—featuring projection, dancing evening, or costumes—for an exceptional musical experience.</div>\n<p><em><a href=\"https://www.osm.ca/en/mystery-ticket/\">Mystery Tickets</a></em> (surprise seats between $28 and $30) are available for this concert! Click on “Buy tickets” and enter the promo code <strong>MYST</strong> to purchase them.</p>\n"
      }
    ]
