    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "At sixteen, Schubert composed a quartet brimming with youthful energy, a legacy of his family concerts. Debussy, in turn, infused his only quartet with bold harmonies and a luminous play of tonal colors. With Dreams, Ian Cusson offers evocative music inspired by a Japanese film, where each movement unfolds its own imaginative world. Music chamber concert POETIC MUSICAL TAG: ​ A great classic of the repertoire that takes you on an emotional journey."
      }
