    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>Four exceptional performers come together to present the final leg of their Quebec tours, joined by the OSM conducted by Jean-Michel Malouf in symphonic arrangements by Benoit Groulx. To open this concert, Luce Dufault will sing the love-inspired excerpt from her show <em>Dire combien je t’aime</em>. In the second part, Marie Denise Pelletier, Marie Carmen and Joe Bocan celebrate the breakthrough hit <em>Pour une histoire d’un soir</em>, a musical narrative of friendship and shared passion.</p>\n"
      }
    ]
