    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>Conducted by Fabien Gabel, the OSM welcomes to its stage pianists Katia and Marielle Labèque<em>.</em> Glass’ <em>Double Piano Concerto, w</em>ritten for these two artists, is a work in which soloists and orchestra weave a tapestry of sound in constant flux. The melodic sensuality of Richard Strauss’ <em>Dance of the Seven Veils </em>and of Schmitt’s <em>La tragédie de Salomé</em> bring a touch of exoticism to this program.</p>\n"
      }
