        "@value": "Emily D’Angelo and the TSO at the Maison Symphonique"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>The OSM is delighted to welcome the TSO and conductor Gustavo Gimeno in a programme featuring the exceptional voice of mezzo-soprano Emily D&rsquo;Angelo. They perform <em>enargeia</em>, a suite of art songs by female composers from medieval times to the present day arranged by Jarkko Riihimäki. To complete the program: Brahms&rsquo; dramatically intense and creatively powerful Symphony no. 1.</p>\n"
      }
    ]
