        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>Dive into a treasure trove of rarely heard cello masterpieces, from Franchomme&rsquo;s revealing Chopin transcriptions to Offenbach&rsquo;s sumptuous compositions, offering a journey of velvet tones and expressive intensity.</p>\n"
      }
    ]
  },
