        "@value": "Joined by renowned soloists and commanding colossal vocal and instrumental means, Rafael Payare conducts a monument of the post-Romantic repertoire: Schoenberg’s Gurre-Lieder. Here’s five good reasons to come and hear Schoenberg’s Gurre-Lieder!"
