        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Under Osmo Vänskä’s direction, Sibelius’s <em>Karelia Suite</em> opens like a northern landscape: winter clarity, pure lines, quiet fervor. This music, at on..."
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#locale": [
