    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>Experience the intensity of the Concours musical international de Montréal’s Final with the Orchestre symphonique de Montréal—the Concours’ official orchestra—under the baton of guest conductor Sascha Goetzel.</p>\n<p>In the first evening of the Final, dedicated to the music of Mozart, on June 3 at 7:30 p.m., five finalists compete with elegance and virtuosity.</p>\n<p>Discover how these young violinists interpret Mozart&rsquo;s genius and bring their personalities to life through the pages of the Viennese master&rsquo;s music. A moment of finesse and pure emotion that will determine the three finalists for the Concours musical international de Montréal 2026’s Grand Final.</p>\n<p>Choice of concertos: Mozart’s violin concertos n<sup>os</sup> 1 to 4.</p>\n"
      }
    ]
