    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\">In Shostakovich’s work, the OSM will be joined by young musicians from higher education institutions as part of the <a href=\"https://www.osm.ca/en/immersion-orchestrale/\">Orchestral Immersion</a> project. This program is made possible thanks to the generous support of Ann Birks as well as Tom Wilder, founder of Wilder &amp; Davis luthiers.</span></p>\n<p><strong>The students</strong><br />\nHenry Baker, trumpet**<br />\nAdrien Faucher-Thibault, percussion*<br />\nJuliette Fortier, horn*<br />\nMaya Hilke-Stolle, violin**<br />\nGrantham Kane, cello**<br />\nFlavie Lacoste, oboe *<br />\nLuc-André Larose, violin ***<br />\nHaolin Liu, bassoon*<br />\nElizabeth Martinez Ramirez, viola ***<br />\nAlicia Miguelez, harp*<br />\nErin Sercel, clarinet**<br />\nLayla Sieun Park, violin**<br />\nYosra Zaazaa, tenor trombone *<br />\nJin Dong Zhao, flute*</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\">* Conservatoire de musique de Montréal<br />\n** Schulich School of Music, McGill University<br />\n*** Faculté de musique de l’Université de Montréal<br />\n</span></p>\n"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://www.osm.ca/temporary/3878689a-ecb2-4b02-a25c-746a26c95ade",
