      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>Clarinetist Kinan Azmeh captivates audiences with his fluid, nuanced playing and remarkable improvisational talent. Joined by the OSM, he will showcase a program that blends creative freedom, Bartók’s folk-inspired motifs, and Carl Philipp Emanuel Bach’s innovative sensitivity. The evening concludes with Mozart’s graceful and elegant <em>Symphony No. 39</em>.</p>\n"
