        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Bal des enfants – Beauty, the Beast and the Orchestra - Orchestre symphonique de Montréal"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Fundraising Event This Valentine’s Day, the characters of Beauty and the Beast will come to life at the heart of the orchestra. In our musical interpretation of the tale, children and adults alike will be swept away into a series of scenes filled with adventure and tenderness! As the story unfolds, the Orchestra will transform, becoming in turn an enchanted castle, a dark forest, and a joyful village. For this Bal des enfants celebrating love, let yourself be carried away by the voices of our heroes and the magic of the orchestra… and dive into a tale where music turns every note into emotion. *This concert is presented in French only."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/inLanguage": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "fr-CA"
      }
    ]
