        "@value": "Olympic Symphony  - Orchestre symphonique de Montréal"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Every two years, millions of people are inspired by the incredible feats of Olympic athletes. This concert invites audiences, young and old, to experience the stirring emotion of national anthems and the deep connection between rhythm and breath. Throughout history, music and sport have gone hand in hand—join us as we celebrate their enduring bond in spectacular fashion! In French / For ages 6 and up Consult the pedagogical guide"
      }
