    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>Discover the Happy Symphonic Hour version of our December 3 program and be swept away by nostalgic European sounds and iconic Hollywood melodies. This 60-minute concert also offers a chance to meet comedian Philippe-Audrey Larrue-St-Jacques, who will be hosting the evening. Plus, you’ll have the opportunity to discover—or rediscover—the incredible violinist Simone Lamsma, acclaimed for her outstanding performance in 2024.</p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://www.osm.ca/en/concert/echoes-of-europe-in-hollywood/\">A similar concert is presented on December 3, 2025 at 7:30 p.m</a></strong></p>\n"
      }
