    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>Rafael Payare continues the Mahler cycle he launched in 2022 with <em>Symphony No. 9</em>, an instrumental masterpiece of unparalleled richness, where every note resonates with deep emotion. In this work, Mahler evokes humanity’s reconciliation with the universe, weaving deep spirituality with moments of awe-inspiring beauty. A rare opportunity to experience a concert that is both musically intense and introspective.</p>\n"
      }
    ]
