    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Your Symphonic Essentials – Express"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>A 60-minute concert customised to <strong>YOUR preferences</strong>, featuring the greatest hits of classical music!</p>\n<p>What if we explored the great repertoire as if leafing through a book of short stories? Here, Grieg’s most famous dawn, born in the madness of <em>Peer Gynt</em>; further on, Mozart’s horn, conceived as a playful wink to a mischievous virtuoso; then Elgar’s <em>Nimrod</em>, a secret tribute to a silent friend; and Beethoven, whose four notes changed history. Rachmaninoff, Wagner, Prokofiev… and in the midst of it all, the inimitable P. D. Q. Bach—the only fictional offspring of a real dynasty, a deliberately offbeat genius and deliciously parodic spirit.</p>\n<p>In this joyful vein, <strong>the OSM invites you to choose two works to complete the program</strong>: a tailor-made, playful, interactive concert featuring two exceptional soloists, Catherine Turner and Carter Johnson.</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">To vote for the works you would like to hear, click on the link indicated in your order confirmation, sent to you by email a few minutes after your purchase. The voting deadline is September 28, 2026.</span></p>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f8f4ff; border: 2px solid #7d50b3; padding: 25px; margin: 20px 0; border-radius: 0px; color: #2c2c2c; line-height: 1.6; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); width: 100%;\"><strong><em>EXPRESS</em> MUSICAL TAG: </strong>​<br />\nClassical concert presented without intermission, in a relaxed and welcoming atmosphere!</div>\n<p><em><a href=\"https://www.osm.ca/en/mystery-ticket/\">Mystery Tickets</a></em> (surprise seats between $28 and $30) are available for this concert! Click on “Buy tickets” and enter the promo code <strong>MYST</strong> to purchase them.</p>\n"
      }
    ]
  },
